    <item>
      <title>Fractal Path Tracer</title>
      <link>https://nshelton.github.io/home/fractalpathtracing/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 20 Feb 2020 00:13:37 -0600</pubDate>
      <guid>https://nshelton.github.io/home/fractalpathtracing/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;I decided to take my fractal rendering to the NEXT LEVEL by implementing a simple compute shader path tracer in unity.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Code Mostly Lifted from &lt;a href=&#34;http://three-eyed-games.com/2018/05/12/gpu-path-tracing-in-unity-part-2/&#34;&gt;Three Eyed Games&lt;/a&gt; tutorial&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/nshelton/FractalPathTracing&#34;&gt;Source Code on github&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;temporal-reprojection&#34;&gt;Temporal Reprojection&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;But then I decided to reproject frames from the past into the current buffer to improve convergence, and make it pretty much realtime. Will add some more about this later&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;renders&#34;&gt;Renders&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;a href=&#34;https://nshelton.github.io/img/fractalpathtracing/0.jpg&#34; class=&#34;galleryThumb&#34; data-toggle=&#34;lightbox&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://nshelton.github.io/img/fractalpathtracing/0.jpg&#34; class=&#34;img-fluid&#34;/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;a href=&#34;https://nshelton.github.io/img/fractalpathtracing/1.jpg&#34; class=&#34;galleryThumb&#34; data-toggle=&#34;lightbox&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://nshelton.github.io/img/fractalpathtracing/1.jpg&#34; class=&#34;img-fluid&#34;/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;a href=&#34;https://nshelton.github.io/img/fractalpathtracing/2362.156-625.jpg&#34; class=&#34;galleryThumb&#34; data-toggle=&#34;lightbox&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://nshelton.github.io/img/fractalpathtracing/2362.156-625.jpg&#34; class=&#34;img-fluid&#34;/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;    &#xD;&#xA;    &lt;a href=&#34;https://nshelton.github.io/img/fractalpathtracing/2706.718-677.jpg&#34; class=&#34;galleryThumb&#34; data-toggle=&#34;lightbox&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://nshelton.github.io/img/fractalpathtracing/2706.718-677.jpg&#34; class=&#34;img-